    feat(pi-notify-termux): auto-dismiss replaced status notification after 2s

    Direct Reply only poisons the original notification instance; the
    replacement (same id re-notify) is a fresh instance so remove works.
    Status notices (✅ 已收到 / ⏰ 已超时) now flash for 2s and dismiss
